OL,3,GNEWSALido plan for leisure centre site
OL,4,Amoves forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has given the green light for
OL,7,Fthe redevelopment of social centre into
OL,8,Fa lido to move forward.
OL,10,FWinchester City Council's cabinet voted
OL,11,Fin favour of disposing of the former
OL,12,FRiver Park social centre site and
OL,13,Fselecting Sea Lanes as the preferred
OL,14,Fbidder.
OL,16,FJustin Rowles, from Winchester Lido
OL,17,FGroup, told a meeting on Wednesday such
OL,18,Fpools were "community hubs" that
OL,19,Fbenefited people's social lives, as
OL,20,Fwell as mental and physical health.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
