OL,3,GNEWSALido plan for leisure centre site
OL,4,Amoves forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeeting chair, Lib Dem councillor
OL,7,FMartin Tod, said it was "the right
OL,8,Fdecision" to lead the way forward to "a
OL,9,Freally good outcome for the city".
